#. 俺がダイイングメッセージを
#. 見つけたのは…
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I can tell you exactly when\n"
"I found the dying message..."
msgstr ""

#. オーガの<CLT 9>死体を
#. 発見した時<CLT>だべ！
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "When <CLT 9>Ogre's body was discovered<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. 私がダイイングメッセージを
#. 見つけたのは…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And I can tell you when\n"
"*I* found the dying message..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>捜査が始まった後<CLT>
#. だったわ。
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"It was only after \n"
"<CLT 9>the investigation had begun<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>雑誌棚の中<CLT>から、
#. 雑誌を取り出して…
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I found the magazine tucked\n"
"away on the <CLT 9>magazine shelf<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. そこでダイイングメッセージに
#. 気付いたのよ。
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"When I pulled it out,\n"
"I saw her final words..."
msgstr ""

#. それが…
#. どうしたんだって…
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What's your problem?"
msgstr ""

#. なーんも、
#. おかしくねーって！！
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What I said makes total sense!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>私が呼びに行った後だね…<CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>It was after I went to get them...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>葉隠があやしいわ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Hiro's lying...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>なるほどな…<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>Interesting...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>だから…なんだよ…<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>So then...what?<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 26>やっぱり葉隠だよ！<CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "<CLT 26>It was Hiro after all!<CLT>"
msgstr ""
